@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FB
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #355777
skinparam ActorBorderColor #355777
skinparam ArrowColor #355777
hide footbox
autonumber
title Read review and learning totals

' Sources relative to repository root:
' backend/app/api/routes/reviews.py
' backend/app/services/reviews/service.py
' backend/app/services/reviews/queries.py
' backend/app/core/time.py

actor Client
participant "FastAPI route" as API
participant "Service" as S
database PostgreSQL as DB
ref over Client, DB : 02_access_authentication: resolve active bearer session or return 401
note over API : Invalid request parameters / body return 422 before service execution.

Client -> API : GET /api/v1/reviews/summary
API -> S : review_summary(db, user)
S -> S : Resolve next local midnight using user timezone
S -> DB : Count saved words; count reviews due before next local midnight
S -> DB : Count learned Common words\nCount distinct union of learned and saved normalized words
DB --> S : Counts
S --> API : saved_count, due_count, daily_remaining=50, learned_count, total_count
API --> Client : 200; Cache-Control: no-store
note over S : due_count includes overdue and later-today reviews.\ndaily_remaining is a compatibility constant, not a quota.
@enduml
